Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:26:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD review completion confirmation so clean reviews can
 close patch chats

ReviewComplete results prompt the reviewed patch agent for a yes/no completion decision. The controller consumes affirmative and negative answers as workflow state instead of backend chat, reopens closed features before later follow-up work, and the terminal ready marker reflects that closed feature state.
